  "description": "Ahn Si-Young has waited for years for the day he becomes old enough to ask out his crush, Seo Do-Hyun. That day finally comes when Si-Young starts interning at Do-Hyun’s company, albeit with a strange mission: “Have sex with your crush in the office, or you will die.” Even though this is Si-Young’s long-awaited chance at love, is this really the right way to go about it...?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of RIDI's Sengmotjung Danpyeonseon (섹못죽 단편선) Collection.*",
